WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.710
Open Private Media Vault.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.405
Choose your file and select Upload file.

00:00:06.655 --> 00:00:08.872
Wait until it appears in the saved list.

00:00:09.122 --> 00:00:12.245
For a video over fifty megabytes, use the shared

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:15.369
Google Drive folder and add its link under Large

00:00:15.369 --> 00:00:15.716
videos.

00:00:15.966 --> 00:00:17.513
Open Caption and review.

00:00:17.763 --> 00:00:21.134
Save the caption draft, add a title and intended

00:00:21.134 --> 00:00:23.382
use, and submit for Pastor review.

00:00:23.632 --> 00:00:27.210
A saved upload is private; approval does not automatically

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:28.005
publish it.

00:00:28.255 --> 00:00:31.352
If an upload pauses, retry the same file and

00:00:31.352 --> 00:00:33.417
check the list before starting again.
